        "notes": "Jamukha was not simply khan of a 'Khamag-Mongol Khanate'. In 1201 an assembly of major steppe lords enthroned him as Gür Khan/Universal Khan in opposition to Temüjin and Ong Khan; the ensuing campaign quickly collapsed. ATLAS therefore records the secure 1201 anti-Temüjin confederation claim as a representative point rather than assigning Jamukha a fabricated continuous Khamag-Mongol reign."
    },
